{"config": "A-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A02", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": true, "answer": "If data is processed outside India, it must be deleted from servers outside India and brought back to India within 24 hours of processing.", "citations": ["D16_A_0019"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00023654999999999998, "gen_latency_s": 1.6563534999950207, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2766, "output_tokens": 97, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "billed_cost_usd": 0.00023655, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D16_A_0019", "D16_A_0018", "D16_A_0020", "D16_A_0011", "D14_A_0008"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.10326250000071013, "total_latency_s": 1.759770100004971, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A03", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "The cap on Default Loss Guarantee (DLG) cover in digital lending is 5% of the total amount disbursed out of the loan portfolio at any given time.", "citations": ["D16_A_0024", "D16_A_0025"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.000248625, "gen_latency_s": 1.5192469000030542, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2839, "output_tokens": 119, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000248625, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D16_A_0025", "D16_A_0028", "D16_A_0026", "D16_A_0004", "D16_A_0024"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.09630979999928968, "total_latency_s": 1.6156878999972832, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 0.2, "first_hit_rank": 5, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A04", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "An NBFC must report the digital lending apps it uses on the Centralised Information Management System (CIMS) portal of the Reserve Bank of India.", "citations": ["D16_A_0020", "D16_A_0021"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.0002418, "gen_latency_s": 1.3172143000047072, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2784, "output_tokens": 110, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "billed_cost_usd": 0.0002418, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D16_A_0013", "D16_A_0021", "D16_A_0019", "D16_A_0020", "D16_A_0018"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.0958226000002469, "total_latency_s": 1.413173300003109, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 0.25, "first_hit_rank": 4, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A05", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "The digital view of loan offers from matching lenders must include the name(s) of the lender(s) extending the loan offer, the amount and tenor of the loan, APR, monthly repayment obligation and penal charges (if applicable), and a link to the KFS for each lender, in a manner that enables the borrower to make a fair comparison between offers.", "citations": ["D16_A_0012"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00026347499999999994, "gen_latency_s": 1.2795722000009846, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2881, "output_tokens": 158, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000263475, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D16_A_0012", "D12_A_0051", "D12_A_0068", "D16_A_0018", "D12_A_0040"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.10285590000421507, "total_latency_s": 1.3825741999971797, "hit@5": 0, "rr@10": 0.0, "first_hit_rank": null, "gold_cited": false}
{"config": "A-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A06", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "Yes. An NBFC may retain a reasonable one‑time processing fee if a borrower exits a digital loan during the cooling‑off period, provided that fee is disclosed to the customer up front.", "citations": ["D16_A_0016"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.0002505, "gen_latency_s": 1.513068200001726, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2720, "output_tokens": 155, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "billed_cost_usd": 0.0002505, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D16_A_0016", "D16_A_0019", "D16_A_0015", "D16_A_0004", "D16_A_0018"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.10754249999445165, "total_latency_s": 1.6207591999991564, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A07", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "No. Under the Reserve Bank of India’s 2025 Non‑Banking Financial Companies – Credit Facilities Directions (updated 15 July 2026), an NBFC or its lending service provider (LSP) must not access a borrower’s mobile phone resources such as file and media, contact list, call logs, telephony functions, etc. Any access to camera, microphone or location is limited to one‑time use for KYC purposes with explicit consent.", "citations": ["D16_A_0018"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00027345, "gen_latency_s": 1.9417462999990676, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2870, "output_tokens": 194, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "billed_cost_usd": 0.00027345, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D16_A_0018", "D16_A_0012", "D16_A_0014", "D12_A_0104", "D12_A_0085"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.10170010000001639, "total_latency_s": 2.0436047999974107, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A08", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "If the lender (NBFC) does not reply within 30 days of receiving the complaint, or rejects it wholly or partly and the borrower is dissatisfied, the borrower can lodge a complaint with the Reserve Bank‑Integrated Ombudsman Scheme through the Complaint Management System (CMS) portal or send a physical complaint to the Centralised Receipt and Processing Centre in Chandigarh as prescribed by the Reserve Bank.", "citations": ["D16_A_0017"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.000252225, "gen_latency_s": 1.4842014000023482, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2803, "output_tokens": 140, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000252225, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D16_A_0017", "D16_A_0014", "D16_A_0016", "D16_A_0012", "D16_A_0013"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.10030190000543371, "total_latency_s": 1.5846693999992567, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A09", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "A newly incorporated payment aggregator must have a minimum net‑worth of ₹15 crore when tendering its application for authorisation, and must reach a minimum net‑worth of ₹25 crore by the end of the third financial year following grant of authorisation.", "citations": ["D06_A_0005", "D06_A_0004"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.000266175, "gen_latency_s": 1.6282250000003842, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2797, "output_tokens": 188, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000266175, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D06_A_0005", "D06_A_0006", "D13_A_0006", "D13_A_0012", "D06_A_0004"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.09232719999999972, "total_latency_s": 1.7207006000026013, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A10", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "A non‑bank entity that was operating only as a physical‑payment‑aggregator (PA‑P) must apply for authorisation by 31 December 2025. If it does not file the application by that date, it must inform its banker(s) immediately and cease its business by 28 February 2026.", "citations": ["D06_A_0004"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.000253875, "gen_latency_s": 1.5390781000023708, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2833, "output_tokens": 202, "cache_read_input_tokens": 512, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000253875, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D06_A_0004", "D06_A_0014", "D06_A_0005", "D06_A_0003", "D06_A_0007"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.11790990000008605, "total_latency_s": 1.6571494000017992, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A11", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "A non‑bank payment aggregator must keep the funds it collects for merchants in a separate escrow account maintained with a Scheduled Commercial Bank (SCB) in India.", "citations": ["D06_A_0014"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00020775, "gen_latency_s": 1.7364237000001594, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2582, "output_tokens": 111, "cache_read_input_tokens": 512, "billed_cost_usd": 0.00020775, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["X01_A_0000", "D06_A_0002", "D06_A_0003", "D06_A_0010", "D06_A_0014"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.09653629999957047, "total_latency_s": 1.833098400005838, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 0.2, "first_hit_rank": 5, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A12", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": true, "answer": "Existing payment aggregators were required to achieve a net‑worth of ₹15 crore by 31 March 2021 and a net‑worth of ₹25 crore by 31 March 2023.", "citations": ["D05_A_0003"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.0002517, "gen_latency_s": 1.7172735999993165, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2920, "output_tokens": 173, "cache_read_input_tokens": 512, "billed_cost_usd": 0.0002517, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D05_A_0004", "D05_A_0003", "D05_A_0005", "D06_A_0005", "D05_A_0000"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.11243519999698037, "total_latency_s": 1.8298442000013893, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 0.5, "first_hit_rank": 2, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A13", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "For any digital payment transaction that is not a card‑present transaction, the directions require that at least one of the authentication factors be dynamically created or proven – i.e., the proof of possession of the factor must be unique to that transaction.", "citations": ["D10_A_0002"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.000243375, "gen_latency_s": 1.6219626999954926, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2741, "output_tokens": 126, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000243375, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D10_A_0002", "D10_A_0001", "D10_A_0006", "D10_A_0000", "D10_A_0004"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.09835549999843352, "total_latency_s": 1.720493400003761, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A14", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "All Payment System Providers and Payment System Participants must comply with RBI's Authentication Mechanisms Directions, 2025 by April 01, 2026.", "citations": ["D10_A_0000", "D10_A_0001"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.000233325, "gen_latency_s": 1.3457524999976158, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2867, "output_tokens": 125, "cache_read_input_tokens": 512, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000233325, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D10_A_0000", "D10_A_0001", "D10_A_0004", "D10_A_0002", "D10_A_0005"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.09845330000098329, "total_latency_s": 1.444333400002506, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-dense-gptoss20b", "qid": "A15", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "The directions mandate that digital‑payment transactions be authenticated by at least two distinct factors, and that at least one factor be dynamic (unique to each transaction). Importantly, the factors must be robustly independent – compromise of one factor must not affect the reliability of the other factor.", "citations": ["D10_A_0002"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00022830000000000002, "gen_latency_s": 1.6746670999928028, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2696, "output_tokens": 151, "cache_read_input_tokens": 512, "billed_cost_usd": 0.0002283, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D10_A_0002", "D11_A_0007", "D06_A_0006", "D06_A_0022", "D13_A_0013"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.07951989999855869, "total_latency_s": 1.7543586000028881, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
